1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,431
The controller asks you to confirm or edit your device name.

2
00:00:04,381 --> 00:00:07,499
Tap Pair, then wait for the connection.

3
00:00:07,499 --> 00:00:10,992
Relay may take up to ten seconds to start.

4
00:00:10,992 --> 00:00:13,904
The connected controller is shown here.

5
00:00:13,904 --> 00:00:22,048
Use this same browser or installed web app later: it remembers the pairing unless its data is cleared or the device is removed.

